priate access for Go SIG maintainers.\\n\\n  - Consider manual recreation of older OSS-Fuzz issues if needed; revisit auto GitHub issue filing after triage process matures.\\n\\n  - Take ownership of otelhttp issue [#7254](https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-contrib/issues/7254); draft a document clarifying error marking approach and semconv alignment.\\n\\n  - Enable GitHub signature releases for OTel Go; update releasing docs; ensure artifacts are uploaded at release time and signatures published. Reference: [sig-security #164](https://github.com/open-telemetry/sig-security/issues/164).\\n\\n- Damien:\\n\\n  - Open an issue to kick off an audit of the otelhttp API for stabilization and coordinate reviews.\\n\\n- David (dashpole):\\n\\n  - Monitor semconv RPC stabilization efforts; once stable, drive otelgrpc module stabilization.\\n\\n  - Sync with Josh regarding gRPC team engagement; explore KubeCon conversations if feasible.\\n\\n- Mike:\\n\\n  - Iterate on the otel Explorer Go docs schema:\\n\\n    - Align with OTEL semantic conventions.\\n\\n    - Ensure Weaver compatibility.\\n\\n    - Provide a JSON Schema (or CUE) for validation.\\n\\n    - Consider linking instrumentations to existing semconv references.\\n\\n- Tyler:\\n\\n  - Assign relevant GitHub tasks/issues from this meeting.\\n\\n  - Confirm KubeCon schedule and cancel the Zoom SIG meeting during KubeCon week; share booth details with the community.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"robert paj ą k david ashpol mike blum action item robert work with gc to set up a maintain mail list for os fuzz notif and ensur appropri access for go sig maintain consid manual recreat of older os fuzz issu if need revisit auto github issu file after triag process matur take ownership of otelhttp issu 7254 http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go contrib issu 7254 draft a document clarifi error mark approach and semconv align enabl github signatur releas for otel go updat releas doc ensur artifact are uplo