{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_11","type":"agent_message","text":"Yes. The SIG approved the OTelConf RC-support PR on November 20; the linked OTelConf issue was closed on December 4, and the next release—published December 8—explicitly included a `v0.0.14` module release alongside Go `v1.39.0`. That is the OTelConf RC shipment. [SRC-NOTE-07](https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/issues/6648#issuecomment-3581463689) [SRC-ISSUE-05](https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-contrib/issues/8059) [SRC-REL-01](https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/releases/tag/v1.39.0)"}}
